    <description>YV20-227 | A04-04 | D-042 | New version (Draft): an Order without a Department gets it from its Budget Framework, or on create from the user (User.Order_Department__c, matched to Department__c.Order_Department__c). Never overwrites a Department already set. The Desk logic below is unchanged.
